th("So, the six big mistakes, quickly, before you go.","shelf")
full("the lineup of flawed candles beside one perfect petal-topped candle","Wrong wick, overheating, too much fragrance, pouring hot, long wicks, and no patience.","wide")
full("a lineup of five finished beginner candles, petal-topped and glowing together","Dodge those six, and five candles from one kit can look like this.","close-up",subj="hero_candle")
